---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manages an environment's secrets

Usage: secret [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list   Lists the environment's secrets: names and versions, never values
  set    Stores a secret, read from standard input or from a variable of this shell, never from the command line. It applies at the environment's next deployment
  unset  Removes a secret at the environment's next deployment
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

  -h, --help
          Print help
